{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Cover.</b> A cover for the ark — it was open at the top, and he places upon it a kind of slab." "<b>Two and a half cubits its length.</b> The length of the ark; its width — the width of the ark. It rests upon the thickness of the four walls, and even though no measure is given for its thickness, our Rabbis explained that its thickness was one handbreadth (Sukkah 5)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:26.993789326Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}